    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是以前在这个屋顶上告诉我\n摔角鹰人的情况的那个人吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F4EE5524D57288FD94E2A5C4B98764E0A544A8BC96211000A645489D29E704EBA768460C551B5768490A34E2A4EBA5427FF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是喂它吃东西的那个人吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F55825B8354034E1C897F768490A34E2A4EBA54270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！在那之后\n我顺利见到摔角鹰人了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不过它当时一副精疲力尽的样子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF01572890A34E4B540E000A6211987A522989C15230645489D29E704EBA4E86FF0100100001BE00000A4E0D8FC75B835F5365F64E00526F7CBE75B2529B5C3D768468375B50300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是……从那以后，\n总感觉它变得有点怪怪的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F202620264ECE90A34EE5540EFF0C000A603B611F89C95B8353D85F97670970B9602A602A7684300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它经常会眺望远方，\n就像是回想起了什么一样……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B837ECF5E384F1A773A671B8FDC65B9FF0C000A5C3150CF662F56DE60F38D774E864EC04E484E0068372026202600100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咻哎啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54BB54CE554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎！？\n摔角鹰人你怎么了？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CEFF01FF1F000A645489D29E704EBA4F60600E4E484E86FF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总感觉它好像想战斗……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B611F89C95B83597D50CF60F3621865972026202600100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咻哎啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54BB54CE554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……难道说\n它是想和你对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202696BE90538BF4000A5B83662F60F3548C4F605BF962185417FF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是想要一雪前耻吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F60F389814E0096EA524D803B54270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为之前它失控了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A4E4B524D5B83593163A74E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊？啊？\n你说的是怎么一回事啊？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF1F554AFF1F000A4F608BF47684662F600E4E484E0056DE4E8B554AFF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我不太明白，\n不过为了实现摔角鹰人的愿望，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就请你和它对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662114E0D592A660E767DFF0C000A4E0D8FC74E3A4E865B9E73B0645489D29E704EBA7684613F671BFF0C00100001BE00000A5C318BF74F60548C5B835BF962185427FF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
