      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F889AD8517480FD548C4F605BF96218FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "复仇战打得漂亮！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "590D4EC7621862535F976F024EAEFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦对战……\n原来这么厉害啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A65BF9621820262026000A539F67658FD94E4853895BB3554AFF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "重点并不在于击溃对手，\n而是在于充分发挥自己的实力啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CD70B95E764E0D57284E8E51FB6E835BF9624BFF0C000A800C662F57284E8E5145520653D1632581EA5DF176845B9E529B554A2026202600100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "摔角鹰人。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果不介意的话，\n你能成为我的搭档吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "645489D29E704EBA300200100001BE01000A5982679C4E0D4ECB610F76848BDDFF0C000A4F6080FD62104E3A62117684642D68635417FF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不光会喂你吃东西，\n还会学习训练家的知识。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D51494F1A55824F6054034E1C897FFF0C000A8FD84F1A5B664E608BAD7EC35BB6768477E58BC6300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想帮上你的忙！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F35E2E4E0A4F6076845FD9FF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……咻哎啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654BB54CE554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就让我再重新和你说一声，\n请多指教啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C318BA96211518D91CD65B0548C4F608BF44E0058F0FF0C000A8BF7591A630765595566FF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你和摔角鹰人对战！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60548C645489D29E704EBA5BF96218FF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我曾经觉得野生宝可梦\n生活在城市里会很辛苦，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n没想到宝可梦这种生物很强大啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621166FE7ECF89C95F9791CE751F5B9D53EF68A6000A751F6D3B572857CE5E0291CC4F1A5F888F9B82E6FF0C00100001BE00000A6CA160F352305B9D53EF68A68FD979CD751F72695F885F3A5927554A300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也要和摔角鹰人一起\n为了变得更强而努力加油！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
